    "show_share": true,
    "description": "The Orthopaedic Section of the Aga Khan University, in collaboration with Pakistan Orthopaedic Association and Pakistan Arthroplasty Society, successfully organised \"First International Hip & Knee Arthroplasty Symposium\" at the Centre for Innovation in Medical Education on April 28-29, 2018.",
